Third-party data

extension/data/technologies.json, categories.json, groups.json and
extension/data/icons/* are generated by scripts/import-fingerprints.js from
https://github.com/enthec/webappanalyzer (GPL-3.0), the community continuation
of the Wappalyzer fingerprint database. They are not committed to this repo;
run the import script to regenerate them. Their license is the reason this
project is GPL-3.0.

Brand icons in that set belong to their respective owners.
